  "estCost": "$5 MIL-$10 MIL",
  "costNotes": null,
  "costReasonable": null,
  "why_pays": "Upon enlarging storm water lines, installing storm water backflow devices, and making improvements to open space it is anticipated the Village will be able to adequately hold and/or safely move storm water up to a 30 year event. With the additional capacity, homes along Alder Lane, Dusenberry Road, Forest Lane, and Ridgecroft Road would experience minimal flooding and significant reductions in property damage following rain events. Although the Village anticipates some localized flooding on individual properties, the storm-water improvements will reduce large scale flooding.",
